  "name": "Harden web loading, tree navigation, and browser coverage",
  "slug": "harden-web-loading-tree-navigation",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "Make read-only web routes recover from failed or stalled API requests, make the dependency tree navigable and accessible at scale, repair mobile navigation names, and add frontend/browser regression gates.",
    "details_md": "",
    "acceptance": [
      "tree, review, stale, and questions show explicit error states with retry and abort stale requests",
      "route render failures show a useful route-level fallback",
      "tree roots remain visible, nested branches collapse at a sensible default depth, and icon controls expose accessible labels/tooltips",
      "tree expansion persists across navigation or reload and expand/collapse-all commands are available",
      "mobile navigation retains accessible names without visual overlap",
      "DOM component tests and Playwright desktop/mobile smoke tests cover retry, keyboard navigation, collapse, layout, nonblank rendering, and accessibility basics",
      "browser prerequisites and CI/release implications are documented"
    ],
